   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Quiet subtle: median ~72, deep blacks (p1 ~4), neutral shadows (30,27,26), neutral-warm highlights (213,210,204), balanced reds/oranges 49% and blue 18%, saturation 0.30. Best for: Small quiet moments, gestures and glances, soft light in the city, documentary coverage with restraint. Understated.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
